  unitName: "Ramlethal (7\u2605)"
  unitId: 860377
  unitNumber: 8304
  description: A young woman from another world who fights with a familiar known
    as Lucifero, and twin Greatswords. As a non-human life form of the Valentine
    variety, Ramlethal was originally tasked with the destruction of humanity until
    she was captured following her lone declaration of war. At first she claims that
    she is but a mere emotionless tool created to serve the Universal Will. However,
    she eventually learns that she is considered an enemy due to an attack humanity
    had suffered at the hands of a previous Valentine...
  summonDesc: Once your role is fulfilled, you no longer have a purpose. I pity the
    future...
  fusionDesc: I no longer have a purpose.<br>There's no meaning to this world.
